        end_time_formatted: "2026-09-17 23:59",
        detail: "T. Stacy\'s Team Awesome Thu, Sep 17 T. Stacy’s Team Awesome project mixes a jazz approach to pop music and a pop approach to jazz. The Human League, Thelonious Monk, Madonna, Wayne Shorter, Duran Duran, Michael Jackson and more. \n \n T.J. Stacy is a Jazz musician, composer and producer. He studied music at The New School with David Fiuczynski (Meshell Ndegeocello, Screaming Headless Torsos); and M-base Collective guitarist David Gilmore (Wayne Shorter, Steve Coleman); and participated in master classes and ensemble classes with Jim Hall, Kenny Werner, Cecil Bridgewater, Adam Holzman, Doug Weiss, Reggie Workman. Originally from Brooklyn he now resides in Asheville, NC. \n \n Weekdays: No upfront ticket charge is required for reservations; however, a $10 cover per guest will be collected at the door. \n 07:00 PM SHOW 08:30 PM SHOW",
