        end_time: "8:00 PM",
        name: `Free Entry | Sunday with Chronology Music + Casablanca Cigar Sip & Smoke`,
        sort_time: "2026-09-20 17:00:00",
        end_time_formatted: "2026-09-20 20:00",
        detail: "Free Entry | Sunday with Chronology Music + Casablanca Cigar Sip & Smoke Sun, Sep 20 Sunday Afternoon at Hotel Eve: 5-8pm | Free Entry \n \n Chronology brings together longtime collaborators Frank Southecorvo and Bryan White, formerly of Up Jumped Three, for an open and conversational take on jazz. \n \n Hosted in a relaxed, outdoor courtyard setting when weather allows ~ moved indoors to the Listening Room if needed. \n \n Casablanca will be hosting their monthly Cigar Sip & Smoke in the Courtyard (weather permitting) with cigars available for purchase. The Hotel Eve Cocktail Lounge is open 4pm-10pm. \n \n Listed for info only (seating is first come, first served; this is a FREE drop-in session). \n \n 5-8PM Drop In",
