        end_time_formatted: "2026-09-23 23:59",
        detail: "The Queen Sessions V4 | Featuring Shana Tucker Wed, Sep 23 Join us for a soulful birthday celebration with Shana Tucker, featuring her inimitable ChamberSoul cello and vocals . This concert marks Shana\'s first Asheville performance since 2021. With her signature cello-infused, jazz-tinged sound, Shana has chosen to honor her patron saint, Sade, juxtaposing classics like \"Sweetest Taboo\" and \"Love is Stronger Than Pride\" with original selections drawn from a similar sultry, sophisticated well. \n \n Featuring Isaac Hadden (guitar) \n Quinn Sternberg (bass) \n Al Sergel IV (drums) \n \n This is an intimate night of soul, jazz, and celebration of Sade\'s musical timelessness and Shana\'s return to Asheville. Come celebrate the birthday girl and the queen who inspired her. \n \n Curated by Melissa McKinney. \n 07:00 PM SHOW 08:30 PM SHOW",
