        detail: "Jorge Garcia Trio Thu, Oct 29 Guitarist Jorge Garcia brings his unmistakable touch to the stage at Hotel Eve. Garcia’s intense passion for the guitar is immediately visible (and equally audible) through his soulful original compositions, melodic improvisations, and rhythmic precision. \n \n Over the course of his career, Garcia has performed alongside legendary artists including Tony Bennett, Richie Cole, Patti Page, Andrea Bocelli, Candido Camero, Cécile McLorin Salvant, and Jon Faddis. \n \n His discography includes Athenas, The Sound of Strings, The Color of Notes (with Federico Britos and Israel “Cachao” López), Hot Club of the Americas, Crossover, Dedicated to You (with Richie Cole), and Voyage. His recording Crossover was featured in Vintage Guitar Magazine, while his 2022 release Dedicated to You received praise from DownBeat Magazine and other outlets. His 2025 release Still Crossing has surpassed 100,000 streams. \n \n Advance Reservations are recommended, $10/Door \n 07:00 PM SHOW 08:30 PM SHOW",
